OL,3,GNEWSAProbation order for man who sent
OL,4,Aundercover officer posing as teen naked
OL,5,Apicture
OL,6,
OL,7,FA 59-year-old man, who tried to
OL,8,Fsexually groom a child into meeting him
OL,9,Fduring an undercover police operation,
OL,10,Fhas been handed a three-year probation
OL,11,Forder.
OL,13,FNicholas Finton O'Brien, of Oakham
OL,14,FStreet, off the Falls Road in west
OL,15,FBelfast, had previously pleaded guilty
OL,16,Fto attempting to meet a child following
OL,17,Fsexual grooming through apps Grindr and
OL,18,FSnapchat.
OL,20,FO'Brien, who is originally from County
OL,21,FWaterford, also admitted a charge of
OL,22,Fattempted communication with a child.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
